{'symbol': 'PGR', 'date': '2023-02-21 15:38:00', 'title': 'PROGRESSIVE ANNOUNCES INVESTOR RELATIONS EVENT', 'text': 'MAYFIELD VILLAGE, OHIO, FEB. 21, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- AS PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED, THE PROGRESSIVE CORPORATION (NYSE: PGR) WILL HOST AN INVESTOR RELATIONS EVENT ON TUESDAY, FEBRUARY 28, 2023, BEGINNING AT 9:30 A.M. EASTERN TIME. THIS EVENT, WHICH WILL CONSIST OF BOTH A CONFERENCE CALL AND A WEBCAST, IS SCHEDULED TO LAST 90 MINUTES AND WILL BEGIN WITH AN APPROXIMATE 45-MINUTE PRESENTATION ON USAGE-BASED INSURANCE, FOLLOWED BY A QUESTION-AND-ANSWER SESSION WITH TRICIA GRIFFITH, OUR CEO, AND JOHN SAUERLAND, OUR CFO. CALL-IN PARTICIPANTS WILL BE ABLE TO ASK QUESTIONS VIA THE PHONE, HOWEVER, WEBCAST PARTICIPANTS WILL NOT BE ABLE TO SUBMIT QUESTIONS ONLINE.'}